[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おはようございます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good morning!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、フロッケちゃん！\u3000おはよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Flocke! Good morning!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "体調は大丈夫？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How are you feeling?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。おかげさまで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm fine, thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの……ハイディさんってまだ来てないですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... has Heidi come in yet?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それが……今日は欠席だって。\n今朝連絡があったみたいで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "About that... she's absent today. Apparently she called in this morning."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、向こうも疲れで体調崩したんじゃない？\n明日にはひょっこり登校してくるでしょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She probably just caught a cold from exhaustion. I'm sure she'll pop back in tomorrow."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ここが研究所か。立派な建物だことで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So this is the research facility. Quite the impressive building."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……よしっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh*... Alright, here goes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すみません。私、先ほどお電話した……\nはい……はい！\u3000主任の娘です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Excuse me. I called earlier... Yes... Yes! I'm the director's daughter."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "急に訪ねてごめん。\n二人に折り入って頼みたいことがあるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry for dropping by so suddenly. I have an important favor to ask both of you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これまで、色々迷惑かけてごめんなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm sorry for all the trouble I've caused."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、友達の願いを叶えるために、\nどうしても二人の力が必要なの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I need your help to make my friend's wish come true."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "父さん、母さん。どうか、お願いします！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dad, Mom. Please, I'm begging you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ハイディさん……今日もお休みだった。\n\u3000これで３日連続。連絡もつかない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Heidi's absent again today. That makes three days in a row. And she's not answering any messages.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配だけど、今はフロッケにできることを……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm worried, but for now I need to focus on what I can do..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――フロッケ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Flocke!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eep!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハ、ハイディさん！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-Heidi?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "や、やっほー。久しぶり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hey there. Been a while."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配してたんですよ！\u3000ずっとお休みだったから……\n今まで何してたんですか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've been so worried! You've been gone for days... Where have you been all this time?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつを作ってたんだ。\nいやー、思ったより手こずっちゃって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was making this. Man, it was trickier than I thought."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、説明するより体験してもらったほうが早いか。\nさ、着けて着けて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, experiencing it will be faster than explaining. Come on, put it on."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？\u3000え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]